# Looplet Accounting — production env (committed to repo)
#
# Only public-by-design VITE_ values live here. Supabase's anon key + URL are
# intentionally exposed to the client (RLS does the actual access control).
# Server-side secrets (XERO_CLIENT_SECRET, SERVICE_ROLE, etc.) NEVER land here —
# they live in Supabase Edge Function secrets.
#
# Cloudflare Pages dashboard env vars don't reliably reach Vite at build time
# (verified empirically 2026-05-06), so we bake the public values in via this
# committed file. Override locally with .env.local if needed.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://dxoikltymmknxqpkpyhi.supabase.co
